---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SITE, TEMPLATES, pathFor } from '../../lib/site';
const lang = 'en' as const;
---
<Layout
  title={`Terms of Service — ${SITE.name}`}
  description="Terms: adult consent, no minors, credits/refunds, no Coldplay/Karol G/CapCut affiliation, no song license, ~30-day photos, ceiling-fan safety."
  canonicalPath="/terms/"
  lang={lang}
>
  <article class="section wrap prose">
    <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
    <p style="color:var(--muted)">Last updated: 2026-10-23</p>

    <h2>1. Service</h2>
    <p>
      {SITE.name} provides a credits-based AI template wall that turns user-uploaded photos into short vertical videos
      across multiple trends ({TEMPLATES.map((t) => t.nameEn).join(', ')}).
      Features may be stubbed until environment keys (e.g. <code>FAL_*</code>, <code>WAFFO_*</code>) are configured.
    </p>

    <h2>2. Adult consent &amp; prohibited content</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>You may only upload photos of adults (18+) who consented (pets allowed where the Create UI states).</li>
      <li>Minors are strictly prohibited.</li>
      <li>No non-consensual deepfakes of real people.</li>
      <li>You warrant you own or have rights to each image.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. No affiliation / no song license / no concert footage</h2>
    <p>
      We are not affiliated with Coldplay, Karol G, CapCut, ByteDance, any record label, or any venue.
      We do not grant or claim a license to any commercial song. Outputs are visual/motion remixes; audio is your responsibility.
      Kiss Cam templates do <strong>not</strong> use real concert footage.
    </p>

    <h2>4. Ceiling Fan safety</h2>
    <p>
      The Ceiling Fan Transition template is an AI effect. You agree not to strap phones or other devices to real spinning fans
      or otherwise create dangerous physical stunts in connection with the Service.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Credits, payments, refunds</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Generates consume credits (default 1 credit per job).</li>
      <li>Payments are processed via Waffo when configured; P0 may show a checkout stub.</li>
      <li>If a paid generate fails due to our pipeline/provider error after debit, we refund that credit.</li>
      <li>Successful renders are generally non-refundable in cash; unused credits remain available subject to these Terms.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>6. Photos &amp; retention</h2>
    <p>
      Uploaded photos are retained approximately {SITE.photoRetentionDays} days for generation and abuse review, then deleted —
      see <a href={pathFor(lang, '/privacy/')}>Privacy</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>7. Disclaimer</h2>
    <p>Service is provided “as is.” AI outputs may be imperfect. You are responsible for how you publish results.</p>

    <h2>8. Contact</h2>
    <p>For legal notices, use the contact channel published by the site operator (GitHub owner <code>ylwl1997</code> / project issues).</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
